### Get all product brands

GET http://localhost:5000/api/product_brands
Content-Type: application/json

### Get product brand with id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/product_brands/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create product brand

POST http://localhost:5000/api/product_brands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "example-brand",
  "title": "Example Brand",
  "description": "Example brand description"
}

### Update product brand

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/product_brands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "code": "example-brand",
  "title": "Example Brand",
  "description": "Updated brand description"
}

### Delete product brand with id

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/product_brands/1
Content-Type: application/json
